cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "icpms-qc"
abstract: >-
  Post-run quality control review for ICP-MS and ICP-OES batch exports. Reads
  instrument export files, applies configurable QC rule packs to calibration,
  continuing calibration verification, internal standards, duplicates and
  blanks, and writes an HTML and JSON report stating whether the batch can be
  reported and why not.
authors:
